# React & UI

## Components

- **Server Components by default** — add `'use client'` only for hooks, events, browser APIs
- `components/ui/` — shadcn primitives (use `cn()` from `@/lib/utils`)
- `components/common/` — LanguageSwitcher, ThemeToggle, LoadingSpinner, ErrorMessage
- `components/layout/` — DashboardShell, AppSidebar, AppNavbar
- `components/forms/` — RHF forms
- Domain UI lives in `features/<domain>/components/`

## Layout

- Locale shell: `src/app/[locale]/layout.tsx` — `<html>`, fonts, `Providers`
- Dashboard routes use `(dashboard)/layout.tsx` + `DashboardShell` (sidebar + navbar + switcher)
- Auth routes use `(auth)/layout.tsx` — centered card, no dashboard chrome

## Theme & feedback

- Dark mode: `ThemeScript` in locale `layout.tsx` (server) + `ThemeProvider` in `providers.tsx` (no `<script>` in client tree — React 19); toggle in `theme-toggle.tsx`
- Toasts: `sonner` — `toast.success()` / `toast.error()`; `<Toaster />` only in `providers.tsx`
- Route-level: `loading.tsx`, `error.tsx` under `[locale]/`

## Icons

- Use `lucide-react` only; consistent `className="h-4 w-4"` in buttons

## New pages checklist

1. Place under `src/app/[locale]/...`
2. Call `setRequestLocale(locale)` + `generateStaticParams` for locales when static
3. All user-visible strings via next-intl
4. Protected routes under `/dashboard` (guarded in `src/proxy.ts`)
